              },
              "content": "我周围这片区域，没有发现琴。\n回忆事发过程……\n琴似乎飞出了沙滩，或许是<style=Highlight>山崖的方向</style>？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204004303_18420902_content",
                "value": "我周围这片区域，没有发现琴。\n回忆事发过程……\n琴似乎飞出了沙滩，或许是<style=Highlight>山崖的方向</style>？",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
